<title>PAKISTAN: Ciba-Geigy (Pakistan) Ltd net falls.</title>
<headline>Ciba-Geigy (Pakistan) Ltd net falls.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1997-03-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31</p>
<p>			  (million rupees)</p>
<p>    Sales		2,875 vs 2,675</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	54 vs    76</p>
<p>    Post-tax profit     24 vs    40</p>
<p>    Dividend	  10 pct vs 20 pct (per 10-rupee share)</p>
<p>NOTE - Ciba-Geigy (Pakistan) Ltd manufactures and markets pharmaceutical products. It carried forward 75 million rupees vs 58 million unappropriated profit to the balance sheet. Book closure April 25 to May 5. AGM on May 5.</p>
<p>-- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
</text>
